# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Hamiltonian setup {#1-hamiltonian-setup}"
msgstr "1. إعداد الهاميلتوني {#1-hamiltonian-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the purposes of this guide, load the electronic structure Hamiltonian of N2 from an FCIDUMP file. There are other means of constructing the [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\"). Be sure to consult its documentation, as well as the [`qiskit_fermions.operators.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-library#module-qiskit_fermions.operators.library \"qiskit_fermions.operators.library\").\n"
msgstr "لأغراض هذا الدليل، حمّل هاميلتوني البنية الإلكترونية لجزيء N2 من ملف FCIDUMP. توجد وسائل أخرى لبناء [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\"). احرص على مراجعة توثيقه، وكذلك [`qiskit_fermions.operators.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-library#module-qiskit_fermions.operators.library \"qiskit_fermions.operators.library\").\n"

